        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ddb06f1d-87e6-4cef-8279-3ec59032b4a8\",\"review_text\":\"Loved it\"},{\"review_id\":\"38347238-5df8-48ab-9490-443ea9f2095e\",\"review_text\":\"Najgorsza aplikacja do streamowania muzyki na Świecie! Nielimitowane zmienianie utworów tylko w wersji premium?! Scam.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f18b185e-29b3-46bd-b8db-2d8bb5dc2257\",\"review_text\":\"Great app❤❤❤❤\"},{\"review_id\":\"0358dca1-323e-425a-9c2e-b53044f5a7a0\",\"review_text\":\"Doe to this new update,I gonna uninstall this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"66b6c04b-3ae0-4919-a6d2-1296040c34af\",\"review_text\":\"Love it but needs music videos\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff806dd6-f4b0-480f-969b-e93b12bd4411\",\"review_text\":\"Without ads this could be rated 5 stars\"},{\"review_id\":\"db39bd49-4275-4c0f-8490-8e0c84d507e0\",\"review_text\":\"It's a good app for music. However it's really stupid how you have to get premium after a certain amount of time just to SKIP songs & SEARCH for songs in your playlist.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9cab63a4-87de-4731-8dd4-4a97cea75d30\",\"review_text\":\"keep your premium to yourself. i accept that it has ad ok I have no problem with that but now every feature tells us to buy subscription, so it's too much for me to continue using this app so bye bye Spotify. Spotify this is worst mistake in my opinion almost everyone now trying to delete your app 😞.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9c4c30b5-2440-489d-bc44-4ff27fecf7fa\",\"review_text\":\"This all is very bad .\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf25551b-33b7-4282-9514-e313a21e0514\",\"review_text\":\"Its just an amazing music application where allows me to discover new either recalls an old memories that I aim to retain.\"}]}"
